    "note": "As introduced (136th GA); Second Amendment Protection Act. Struck text: references to 18 U.S.C. 921, 922 and the National Firearms Act in R.C. 2923.11, 2923.111, 2923.122 and 2923.17 are struck and replaced by 'any applicable state or federal law' or a date-fixed reference to 18 U.S.C. 922(g). The (8) item is added to the list of things 'dangerous ordnance' does not include (R.C. 2923.11(L)). The qualifying-adult age (21) is in R.C. 2923.111(A)(2)(a), unchanged."
